## Response shape

### Top-level: `AdminGenderMonitoringResponse`

```json
{
  "start": "2026-08-03T00:00:00Z",
  "end": "2026-09-02T00:00:00Z",
  "granularity": "DAILY",
  "approved": { "...": "GenderCohortStats" },
  "onboardingComplete": { "...": "GenderCohortStats" },
  "cityDistribution": { "...": "CityDistributionStats" }
}
```

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `start` | ISO instant | Resolved start of the request window |
| `end` | ISO instant | Resolved end of the request window |
| `granularity` | `"DAILY"` \| `"WEEKLY"` \| `"MONTHLY"` | Bucket granularity used for trend arrays |
| `approved` | `GenderCohortStats` | Approved + onboarded cohort |
| `onboardingComplete` | `GenderCohortStats` | All onboarded cohort |
| `cityDistribution` | `CityDistributionStats` | City breakdown for the selected window |

---

### `GenderCohortStats`

```json
{
  "snapshot": { "...": "GenderSnapshot" },
  "cumulativeTrend": [ { "...": "GenderTrendPoint" } ],
  "inflowTrend": [ { "...": "GenderTrendPoint" } ],
  "byProfileStatus": {
    "APPROVED": { "...": "GenderSnapshot" },
    "PENDING": { "...": "GenderSnapshot" },
    "REJECTED": { "...": "GenderSnapshot" }
  }
}
```

| Field | Type | Notes |
|-------|------|-------|
| `snapshot` | `GenderSnapshot` | All-time current pool for this cohort |
| `cumulativeTrend` | `GenderTrendPoint[]` | One point per bucket in `[start, end)`; includes baseline before `start` |
| `inflowTrend` | `GenderTrendPoint[]` | One point per bucket; only **new** completions in that bucket |
| `byProfileStatus` | `Record<string, GenderSnapshot>` | **Only populated on `onboardingComplete`**. Empty `{}` on `approved`. Keys are enum names: `APPROVED`, `PENDING`, `REJECTED`. |

Trend arrays are **dense**: every bucket in the range is present, including buckets with zero new completions.

