## Suggested UI controls

| Control | Behavior |
|---------|----------|
| Date range picker | Sets `start` and `end`. Presets: Last 7d, Last 30d, Last 90d, This month. |
| Granularity toggle | Sets `granularity`. Default `daily`. Use `weekly` for ranges > 90 days. |
| City limit | Optional advanced setting → `cityLimit`. Default 20. |
| Refresh | Re-fetch on range/granularity change. Snapshots are cheap to re-fetch. |
| Loading state | Trends and city data depend on range; show skeleton per chart section. |

