## Difference from `/analytics/demographics`

| | `demographics` (legacy) | `gender-monitoring` (use this) |
|--|-------------------------|-------------------------------|
| Filters | `createdAt` in range only | Cohort filters + hybrid date model |
| Onboarding filter | No | Yes (`onboardingComplete = true`) |
| Profile status filter | No | Yes (approved cohort + status breakdown) |
| Deleted accounts | Included | Excluded |
| Precomputed ratios | No | Yes (`femalePercent`, `maleToFemaleRatio`) |
| Time series | No | Yes (`inflowTrend`, `cumulativeTrend`) |
| City gender split | No | Yes (male/female per city) |
| Response shape | `AdminMetricsResponse` (generic cards) | Dedicated typed response |

